  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• In a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter <br>with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook <br>sesame seeds and half the garlic until fragrant, <br>1-2 minutes. Add the water (for the rice) and a <br>generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.<br>• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce <br>heat to low.<br>• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and <br>keep covered until rice is tender and water  <br>is absorbed, 10 minutes. <br>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so <br>don’t peek!  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-249ae300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, trim green beans and pea pods.<br>• Roughly chop Asian greens. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-05682c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the rice has 10 minutes remaining, heat  <br>a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a <br>drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook pea pods and green beans, tossing, until <br>tender, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Add Asian greens and remaining garlic and cook <br>until fragrant and wilted, 1 minute.<br>• Transfer to a bowl, season to taste with salt and <br>pepper and cover to keep warm. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-51bcdd20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, cut Japanese tofu into quarters.<br>• In a small bowl, combine ginger paste, teriyaki <br>sauce and the water (for the sauce).<br>• In a shallow bowl, combine tofu, cornflour and a <br>pinch of salt. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-d7894d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return the pan to medium-high heat with a <br>generous drizzle of olive oil.<br>• When oil is hot, shake off excess cornflour and cook <br>tofu, tossing, until golden, 3-4 minutes.<br>• Stir in the sauce mixture and toss tofu to coat,  <br>1 minute. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-d3e45c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide sesame rice and garlic greens between bowls.<br>• Top with ginger teriyaki tofu. Spoon over any <br>remaining sauce from the pan.<br>• Sprinkle with crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fee1713d196bd6e04b2/step-a6d1bf50.jpg"
    }
  ]
